          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azilundu zyoonse izyakalimidwe maamba, tokooyoosika limbi kulinzizyo nkaambo kakuyoowa maunga amitubetube. Ziyooba zyakweembelela iŋombe akulyataulwa imbelele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
